'''Refuge Pointe''' is one of the few remaining patches of [[Stromgarde (kingdom)|Stromgarde]] territory. With [[Stromgarde Keep]] in ruins, and most of their populace fled south, the proud remnants of the [[Stromgarde Militia]] still fight on to reclaim their land. It is from Refuge Pointe that the [[Alliance]]'s military operations in the area are conducted, most of which is concerned with aiding the Stromgarde Militia retake their former capital.

